Rule 1 (last dimensions must match when both inputs are non-scalars)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 0 ∨ ndim(v_2) = 0 then true else shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1)
>>
Rule 2 (both inputs must have the same dtype)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_2)
